---
description: >-
  LR-orientation gitgraph extending the not-used-immediately scenario one
  level further: branch x is created and later used, and a sub-branch y is
  created off x and also not used until later, before both merge back
  into x.
---
gitGraph LR:
  commit id:"1-abcdefg"
  branch x
  checkout main
  commit id:"2-abcdefg"
  checkout x
  commit id:"3-abcdefg"
  checkout main
  merge x
  checkout x
  branch y
  checkout x
  commit id:"4-abcdefg"
  checkout y
  commit id:"5-abcdefg"
  checkout x
  merge y
